title: "FADE: A Memory Degradation Architecture for Reliable AI Systems"
abstract: "AI that deliberately forgets like humans do, using memory degradation as an intrinsic confidence signal. Reduces hallucinations, enables epistemic humility, and solves stateful deployment challenges."
